{{also|ص د ر}}
==Arabic==

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ص|د|ر}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sense|to go out|to hit in the chest}} {{ar-IPA|صَدَرَ}}
* {{sense|to have a chest complaint}} {{ar-IPA|صُدِرَ}}
* {{sense|to export}} {{ar-IPA|صَدَّرَ}}
* {{sense|chest}} {{ar-IPA|صَدْر}}
* {{sense|chest}} {{audio|ar|Ar-صدر.ogg|Audio}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I|a|u,i}}

# {{label|ar|intransitive}} to [[emerge]]; to [[come up]]; to [[spring]]; to [[issue]]; to [[rise]]
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|99|6|passage=يَوْمَئِذٍ '''يَصْدُرُ''' النَّاسُ أَشْتَاتًا لِّيُرَوْا أَعْمَالَهُمْ|t=On that Day people '''will proceed''' in separate groups to be shown [the consequences of] their deeds.}}
# to [[materialize]], to [[happen]], to [[occur]]
#: {{syn|ar|حَدَثَ}}
# to [[emerge]] as if from a [[source]], to [[proceed]], to [[emanate]], to [[arise]], to [[originate]], to [[stem]], to [[spring]]
#: {{syn|ar|اِنْبَثَقَ}}
# to be [[issued]] or [[released]]; to be [[public]] or [[available]], to be [[out]]; to [[come out]]; to [[circulate]]

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I|a|u,i|passive=impers|vn=صَدْر،صُدُور،مَصْدَر}}

