# {{tlb|ar|transitive}} to [[export]]
# {{tlb|ar|transitive}} to [[dispatch]]; to [[forward]]; to [[transport]]
# {{tlb|ar|transitive}} to [[preface]]; to [[introduce]]
#: {{syn|ar|قَدَّمَ|مَهَّدَ}}

====Conjugation====
