===Noun===
{{ar-noun|صَدْر|m|pl=صُدُور}}

# {{lb|ar|uncountable}} {{ar-verbal noun of|صَدَرَ|form=I}}
# {{lb|ar|countable}} a [[chest]], a [[breast]]
## a [[bust]], a [[bosom]]
## something [[resemble|resembling]], [[liken]]ed to, or [[relate]]d to [[chests]]  (such as a [[center]], a [[core]], a [[heart]], and so on)
# {{lb|ar|countable}} a [[front]]
#: {{syn|ar|جَبَهَةَ|وَاجِهَة|مُقَدَّمَ}}
#: {{ant|ar|عَجْز|دُبْر|مُؤَخَّرَ}}
## a [[person]] at the [[front]], a [[leader]], a [[commander]]
# {{lb|ar|countable}} a [[beginning]], a [[start]], an [[outset]], a [[commencement]]; an [[inception]]; a [[dawn]], a [[rise]]

